{"version":"2.0","class":"dataset","label":"Harmonised index of consumer prices (HICP) - ECOICOP ver.2 - first released data","source":"ESTAT","updated":"2026-10-16T23:00:00+0200","value":{"0":103.06,"1":103.21,"2":103.68,"3":104.29,"12":2.8,"13":2.9,"14":3.2,"15":3.8,"8":0.0,"9":0.2,"10":0.4,"11":0.6},"status":{"0":"e","1":"e","2":"e","3":"e","12":"e","13":"e","14":"e","15":"e","8":"e","9":"e","10":"e","11":"e"},"id":["freq","unit","coicop18","release","geo","time"],"size":[1,5,1,1,1,4],"dimension":{"freq":{"label":"Time frequency","category":{"index":{"M":0},"label":{"M":"Monthly"}}},"unit":{"label":"Unit of measure","category":{"index":{"I25":0,"I15":1,"RCH_M":2,"RCH_A":3,"RCH_MV12MAVR":4},"label":{"I25":"Index, 2025=100","I15":"Index, 2015=100","RCH_M":"Monthly rate of change","RCH_A":"Annual rate of change","RCH_MV12MAVR":"Moving 12 months average rate of change"}}},"coicop18":{"label":"Classification of individual consumption by purpose (COICOP) - 2018","category":{"index":{"TOTAL":0},"label":{"TOTAL":"Total"}}},"release":{"label":"Release","category":{"index":{"FLS":0},"label":{"FLS":"Flash"}}},"geo":{"label":"Geopolitical entity (reporting)","category":{"index":{"EA20":0},"label":{"EA20":"Euro area – 20 countries (2023-2025)"}}},"time":{"label":"Time","category":{"index":{"2026-06":0,"2026-07":1,"2026-08":2,"2026-09":3},"label":{"2026-06":"2026-06","2026-07":"2026-07","2026-08":"2026-08","2026-09":"2026-09"}}}},"extension":{"lang":"EN","description":"<p>The Harmonised Index of Consumer Prices (HICP) measures price changes of various consumer goods and services over time (inflation).&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>The ‘first&nbsp;released’ dataset stores the original HICP data as&nbsp;released&nbsp;on the official publication dates (non-revised). It includes the full set of indices and monthly and annual rates of change for all geographical entities (aggregates and countries). This dataset is compiled according to the European Classification of&nbsp;Individual&nbsp;Consumption According to Purpose (ECOICOP) ver. 2, available in base years&nbsp;2025=100 and 2015=100.</p><p>As a result of a technical error, the “first released data” dataset [prc_hicp_fpd] for January 2026 published on 25 February 2026 was updated on 3 March 2026.</p><p>The “first released data” published on 25 February 2026 are available&nbsp;<a href=\"https://circabc.europa.eu/ui/group/7b031f10-ac19-4da3-a36f-58708a70133d/library/18632f8f-5c92-4330-95d0-ef25240b44d6\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></p><p><br></p>","id":"PRC_HICP_FPD","agencyId":"ESTAT","version":"1.0","datastructure":{"id":"PRC_HICP_FPD","agencyId":"ESTAT","version":"19.0"},"annotation":[{"type":"CREATED","date":"2026-01-27T09:31:02+0100"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_DOI_XML","title":"<adms:identifier xmlns:adms=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#\" xmlns:skos=\"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core.html\" xmlns:dct=\"http://purl.org/dc/terms/\" xmlns:rdf=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\"><adms:Identifier rdf:about=\"https://doi.org/10.2908/PRC_HICP_FPD\"><skos:notation rdf:datatype=\"http://purl.org/spar/datacite/doi\">10.2908/PRC_HICP_FPD</skos:notation><dct:creator rdf:resource=\"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/corporate-body/ESTAT\"/><dct:issued rdf:datatype=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date\">2026-01-27</dct:issued></adms:Identifier></adms:identifier>"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_HICP_COICOP18_20260128.pdf","text":"Information note"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_HICP_COICOP18_20260128.pdf"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_HICP_COICOP18_20260128.pd